  "description": "PLib - Peter Han's library used for creating mods for Oxygen Not Included, a simulation game by Klei Entertainment.\n    \nContains methods aimed at improving cross-mod compatibility, in-game user interfaces, and game-wide functions such as Actions and Lighting. An easy-to-use Mod Options menu is also included.",
